    "updated_at": "2025-08-01T15:49:10Z",
    "body": "Something similar could be useful for other replaced elements like `<canvas>` and `<picture>`/`<img>`. For example, you might want to apply `dynamic-range-limit` to the image content, but not its CSS backgrounds and borders. So I'd prefer an approach that is not specific to video and its controls.",
